        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-5250, 3-1/4 Inch Exposed Screw Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith vintage industrial decor gaining popularity, it is easy to see the undeniable appeal of the Flat Box Cup Pull made by RK International. The juxtaposition of classic style and industrial looks makes this cabinet cup pull handle all the more desirable. It is available in 7 finishes including distressed nickel, distressed copper, and polished brass (pictured right). It comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-5250 Flat Box Cabinet Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
